                    <li><strong>30 cm</strong> &#x2192; rumah 1-2 lantai</li>
                    <li><strong>40 cm</strong> &#x2192; ruko, kantor 2-3 lantai</li>
                    <li><strong>50 cm</strong> &#x2192; gudang, pabrik kecil</li>
                    <li><strong>60 cm</strong> &#x2192; hotel 3-4 lantai</li>
                    <li><strong>80 cm</strong> &#x2192; gedung 5-8 lantai, apartemen, rumah sakit</li>
